<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>嘉賓須知 / Guest Guidelines</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:300,400,500,700&display=swap" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50">
<div class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
        <!-- Banner -->
        <div class="mb-8 rounded-t-lg overflow-hidden">
            <img src="/images/banner.jpg" alt="Banner" class="w-full h-auto">
        </div>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
            <!-- Chinese Section -->
            <div class="mb-12">
                <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-8 text-center">嘉賓須知</h1>
                
                <div class="prose max-w-none">
                    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        政府將於<strong>2026年2月18日(星期三)下午六時</strong>開始，在香港會議展覽中心一帶實施臨時交通管制措施，直至活動結束。我們建議嘉賓盡量使用公共交通工具前往活動場地，以免耽誤行程。
                    </p>

                    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">請留意以下具體安排：</p>

                    <div class="space-y-6">
                        <!-- 安檢安排 -->
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">安檢安排</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                                賓客在進入大會堂前，須經過現場的隨身物品安檢。
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 博覽道入口 -->
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">博覽道入口</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                                為配合活動期間的交通管制，博覽道入口將於下午六時起關閉。於博覽道落客的車輛，必須於下午六時前離開。
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 港灣道入口 -->
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">港灣道入口</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                                為配合活動期間的交通管制，所有嘉賓由下午六時起將必須經由港灣道入口進入會展。現場將設有清晰指示標誌，並有工作人員在場協助引導，以便各位順利抵達會場。
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 駕車及停泊安排 -->
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">駕車及停泊安排</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                                本次活動不設嘉賓專用泊車位。如必需駕車及使用停車場，建議可使用會場附近的收費停車場，詳情可參閱香港會議展覽中心的網站，但請留意政府公布的最新交通安排。
                            </p>
                            <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded p-4 mt-3">
                                <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                    <strong>備註：</strong>活動進行期間，博覽道將會全面封閉，所有車輛皆不能進入會展半島範圍(近金紫荊廣場一帶)。敬請提前規劃行程，並預留充足時間抵達。
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 落客安排 -->
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">落客安排</h2>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                                    <span class="font-semibold flex-shrink-0 min-w-[120px]">下午6時前</span>
                                    <span class="flex-1">(最終時間以政府公佈為準)：可於港灣道或博覽道入口落客。</span>
                                </li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                                    <span class="font-semibold flex-shrink-0 min-w-[120px]">下午6時至7時</span>
                                    <span class="flex-1">(最終時間以政府公佈為準)：僅限於中環廣場落客。</span>
                                </li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                                    <span class="font-semibold flex-shrink-0 min-w-[120px]">下午7時後</span>
                                    <span class="flex-1">(最終時間以政府公佈為準)：附近所有道路將會封閉。</span>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">中環及灣仔的特別交通安排如下：</p>
                        <div class="mb-6">
                            <img src="/images/map.jpg" alt="中環及灣仔的特別交通安排圖" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">會場及入口位置圖如下：</p>
                        <div class="mb-6">
                            <img src="/images/remind_map_2.jpg" alt="會場及入口位置圖" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-md">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Divider -->
            <div class="border-t-2 border-gray-300 my-12"></div>

            <!-- English Section -->
            <div>
                <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-8 text-center">Guest Guidelines</h1>
                
                <div class="prose max-w-none">
                    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        The Government will implement temporary traffic arrangements in the vicinity of the Hong Kong Convention and Exhibition Centre (HKCEC) on <strong>Wednesday, February 18, 2026, from 6:00 PM</strong> until the conclusion of the event. To ensure your journey remains unaffected by road closures, we encourage our guests to utilise public transportation whenever possible.
                    </p>

                    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Please note the following arrangements:</p>

                    <div class="space-y-6">
                        <!-- Security Arrangement -->
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Security Arrangement</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                                All attending guests are required to go through the bag check counter before entering the Grand Hall.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Expo Drive Entrance -->
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Expo Drive Entrance</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                                In compliance with traffic control measures, the entrance at Expo Drive will close at 6:00 PM. All vehicles using this entrance for drop-off must leave before 6:00 PM.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Harbour Road Entrance -->
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Harbour Road Entrance</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                                In compliance with traffic control measures, all guests shall enter HKCEC via the Harbour Road entrance starting from 6:00 PM. Clear signage will be displayed, and event staff will be on-site to assist with directions and provide arrival support.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Driving and Parking Arrangements -->
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Driving and Parking Arrangements</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                                This event does not provide designated parking spaces for guests. If you must drive, we recommend considering paid parking facilities in the vicinity of HKCEC. For details, please refer to the HKCEC's website. For details regarding road closure arrangements, please refer to the latest traffic announcements by the Government.
                            </p>
                            <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded p-4 mt-3">
                                <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                    <strong>Remarks:</strong> Expo Drive will be completely closed during the event, and no vehicles will be permitted to enter the HKCEC peninsula area (vicinity of Golden Bauhinia Square). Please plan your journey accordingly and allow ample time for your arrival.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Drop-off Arrangements -->
                        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
                            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Drop-off Arrangements</h2>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                                    <span class="font-semibold flex-shrink-0 min-w-[145px]">Before 6pm</span>
                                    <span class="flex-1">(final time subject to the Government's announcement): Guest can drop-off at Harbor Road or Expo Drive entrances.</span>
                                </li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                                    <span class="font-semibold flex-shrink-0 min-w-[145px]">Between 6 and 7pm</span>
                                    <span class="flex-1">(final time subject to the Government's announcement): Drop-off is only available at Central Plaza.</span>
                                </li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                                    <span class="font-semibold flex-shrink-0 min-w-[145px]">After 7pm</span>
                                    <span class="flex-1">(final time subject to the Government's announcement): All roads in the vicinity will be closed.</span>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">Special Traffic Arrangement in Central and Wan Chai are indicated in the map below:</p>
                        <div class="mb-6">
                            <img src="/images/map.jpg" alt="Special Traffic Arrangement in Central and Wan Chai" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">The venue and entrance locations are indicated in the map below:</p>
                        <div class="mb-6">
                            <img src="/images/remind_map_2.jpg" alt="Venue and Entrance Locations" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-md">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Information -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8">
            <div class="text-center">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4">聯絡我們 / Contact Us</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
                    如閣下有任何查詢，請電郵至 
                    <a href="mailto:hkjc_2026cnyfireworks_rsvp@sprg.com.hk" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline">
                        hkjc_2026cnyfireworks_rsvp@sprg.com.hk
                    </a>
                    或致電 
                    <a href="tel:+85221144945" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline">
                        +852 2114 4945
                    </a>
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2">
                    (辦公時間：星期一至五，早上10時至晚上7時，公眾假期除外)
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">
                    For enquiries, please contact us by email at 
                    <a href="mailto:hkjc_2026cnyfireworks_rsvp@sprg.com.hk" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline">
                        hkjc_2026cnyfireworks_rsvp@sprg.com.hk
                    </a>
                    or via telephone on 
                    <a href="tel:+85221144945" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline">
                        +852 2114 4945
                    </a>
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2">
                    (Office hours: Monday to Friday, 10:00 am to 7:00 pm, excluding public holidays)
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
